  {
   "text": "I was dead in my trespasses, I was lying in the grave",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I had nothing I could offer and no strength that I could save",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But God, who is rich in mercy, out of love so deep and wide",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Made us alive together with Christ, he raised us at his side",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For by grace you have been saved through faith",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And this is not from yourselves",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It is the gift of God",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Not from works, so that no one may boast",
   "heard": 2,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He raised us up together and he seated us with him",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 2.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
